Visual enhancements for the procedural galaxy background rendering.
Key changes:
1. Converted to trailing spiral arms by inverting the logarithmic winding direction across all layers.
2. Implemented a faux-3D Gargantua-style accretion disk using tilted screen-space UVs and doppler-beaming color shifts.
3. Added a simulated gravitational lens for the accretion disk situated behind the black hole.
4. Carved out a central 'Core Void' to prevent the galactic bulge and gas layers from washing out the black hole visuals.
